# performance-impr.ai
## GPU-process memory investigation — fserver / frigate game (`client/game.html`)

- Date: 2026-09-21
- App under investigation: `fserver/client/game.html` (board game; "Graphics" setting High/Low; also `client/game/pieces.js`)
- Subject: GPU (pid 15100) process memory in Firefox, specifically growth driven by High-detail animations.

This file records the investigation evidence verbatim (user messages exactly as provided) and a
summary of the analysis that followed, so the evidence can be re-analyzed in future.

---

# PART 1 — VERBATIM USER MESSAGES (evidence)

The following are the user's messages recorded exactly as they were provided. No corrections have
been made (typos and all), so the raw evidence can be re-analyzed.

---

